# Amazon Prime Video Analytics Dashboard

## Project Overview
This Power BI dashboard provides insights into Amazon Prime Video content by analyzing titles, genres, ratings, popularity, release trends, and audience engagement metrics.

## Dashboard Highlights
- Total Titles: 10K+
- Average IMDb Score: 7.71
- Average TMDb Score: 18.01
- Total IMDb Votes: 75M+
- Average Runtime: 88.83 Minutes
- Total Genres: 2K+

## Key Insights
- Analyzed content distribution across genres.
- Identified top-rated titles based on IMDb scores.
- Explored age certification trends.
- Examined release year patterns.
- Compared IMDb and TMDb ratings.
- Created interactive filters for dynamic analysis.

## Tools Used
- Power BI
- Power Query
- DAX
- Data Visualization

